# Changelog

All notable changes to **Jhol** — a cache-first, offline-friendly, npm-compatible
package manager for JavaScript, written in Rust.

This file is reconstructed from the project's git history (137 commits, from the
initial commit on 2026-02-10 through the present) and the session work logs in
`AGENTS.md`. Format follows [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/) and
the project uses [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).

