### Fixed
- **`jhol exec`/`x` now forwards flags to the binary.** `jhol exec tsc --version`
  failed with `error: unexpected argument '--version' found` because jhol's own parser
  consumed it, even though the documented contract is "arguments to pass to the
  binary" — so `jhol exec tsc --noEmit`, `jhol x eslint --fix .` and every real
